Glimpse contains no source from Peek (https://github.com/phw/peek), which is
Copyright Philipp Wolfer and licensed under the GPL-3.0-or-later. Peek is prior
art and an acknowledged influence on the product design — a framing window whose
inner rectangle is the capture region — but no Peek code, resource, or asset is
present here. Glimpse is written in Rust against GTK4 and x11rb, where Peek is
written in Vala against GTK3; the implementations share no expression.

Where Glimpse invokes ffmpeg, the command-line arguments are derived from
ffmpeg's own documentation (https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-devices.html and
https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-filters.html), not transcribed from another project.
